  "de5a2b2a-3a4f-ae79-a528-f9824ece8902": {"longDescription": "Preventing Costly Errors and Correcting Them If They Happen (eBook)\n\nOne small tax mistake can lead to big headaches: delays, penalties, missing deductions, IRS notices, or even an audit.\n\nCommon Tax Mistakes to Avoid is a practical, easy-to-understand eBook designed to help you identify the most common filing errors, learn how to avoid them before they happen, and know what to do if you already made a mistake.\n\nWhether you’re filing your own taxes, earning side income, self-employed, or just trying to stay compliant, this guide helps you feel more confident and prepared during tax season.\n\nIdeal for: Includes both prevention + correction guidance.", "included": ["Filing late or missing the tax deadline", "Underreporting or over-reporting income", "Claiming incorrect deductions and credits", "Math and data-entry errors", "Not reporting self-employment or side income", "Poor record-keeping for deductions", "Misclassifying workers (business owners & freelancers)", "Mistakes in estimated tax payments", "Ignoring IRS notices or failing to respond", "What to do if you’re audited"], "benefits": ["Beginner-friendly and easy to follow", "Helps prevent costly mistakes and reduce stress"], "howto": []},
